  "remaining": [
    "Durable queue retry timestamps, parking/reactivation, subscription historical import, and exact history pagination have independent owners or need their own units.",
    "This projection covers one exact source group and inference key. Overlapping nonidentical groups and multi-key budget atomicity need a compositional shell check. A source lease uses the request deadline in native code.",
    "The authority check intentionally rechecks exact current state through provider start and publication. The legacy law permitting a completed check immediately before revocation identifies a shell interleaving outside this atomic guard.",
    "Private intake claim/routing remains separate. The pinned section 8 report analyzer uses the Surplus-only screening route. The broader section 5 wording needs to be represented precisely without changing the actual configured screening route."
  ]
}
